  Name: A5 Postcard
  Text: "Dear Hronn,                          5/285\r\nThe town of Aurora is a sleepy
    one, with not much to comment on but a small sense of eeriness\u2026 or maybe
    that's just in my head! I met a lovely book keeper, with a very useful bookstore
    there. I will tell you more details in person ;)\r\n\r\nI will write to you again.\r\nYours,\r\nTerra\r\n"
